# {{transitive}} To [[influence]], [[manage]], [[direct]], [[control]] or [[tamper]] with something to one’s own [[advantage]]
# {{transitive}} {{medicine}} To [[handle]] and move a [[body]] part, either as an [[examination]] or for a [[therapeutic]] purpose

